silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_07_yoneda_profile_drill_sections_04_naturality_in_two_variables_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'NatualityInTwoVariablesConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, ColimitFactorizationArrow_VetCarePlan: the concrete arrow g: MittensColimitApex -> VetCarePlan_77 (the unique factorization); used to exhibit the A-naturality square of the Yoneda bijection; also, AlphaNatTrans_ClinicalToGrooming: the natural transformation alpha: ClinicalLabelPresheaf -> GroomingLabelPresheaf that maps clinical record labels to grooming log labels; used to exhibit the F-naturality square of the Yoneda bijection; also, GroomingLabelPresheaf: the concrete second presheaf G used in the F-naturality square; assigns to each D_Mittens source node X the set of grooming log labels recorded for X in GroomingLog_42." .
